      "name": "t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "width": "full-width",
        "title": "Monster Piercing | Accessories",
        "text": "<p>Body jewellery accessories are essential for maintaining and customising your piercings. </p><p>At Monster Piercing, we offer a wide range of accessories to complement your body jewellery collection. Whether you're looking for replacement balls, O-rings, or specialised tools, our accessories collection has everything you need to keep your jewellery secure and stylish. Replacement parts are available in various sizes and materials, ensuring compatibility with your existing jewellery. </p><p>Customising your piercings with different ends or decorative elements can help refresh your look without needing to buy entirely new pieces. Our accessories collection is designed to make maintaining and personalising your piercings both convenient and affordable.</p>",
        "heading_size": "medium",
        "text_alignment": "center"
      }
